1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:01,407
(Howard:)Okay, I'm sorry.

2
00:00:01,619 --> 00:00:03,869
(Howard:)You sent me the picture.
I wasn't thinking.

3
00:00:04,038 --> 00:00:06,918
- Oh, Howie.
- I'm usually pretty good at not blabbing.

4
00:00:07,124 --> 00:00:11,374
(Howard:)You tell me tons of stuff
about these guys, and I never repeat it.

5
00:00:14,048 --> 00:00:16,758
- What do you tell him?
- Oh, you know, just pillow talk.

6
00:00:16,926 --> 00:00:19,386
(Bernadette:)You guys have nothing to worry about.

7
00:00:19,553 --> 00:00:21,933
(Leonard:)Did you talk about us
when we were dating?

8
00:00:22,139 --> 00:00:24,929
(Penny:)No. All your little secrets are fine.

9
00:00:28,896 --> 00:00:31,526
(Bernadette:)Yes, absolutely fine.

10
00:00:33,567 --> 00:00:35,737
Ha-ha-ha. I'll tell you later.

11
00:00:39,073 --> 00:00:41,953
Come on, tumor.

12
00:00:42,159 --> 00:00:43,199
Come on, tumor.

13
00:00:43,369 --> 00:00:47,039
(Amy:)Mama needs
an aggressive little glioblastoma.

14
00:00:47,915 --> 00:00:50,545
Yay, brain tumor.

15
00:00:51,085 --> 00:00:56,025
(Amy:)Probably not the same reaction you had
when you got the news.

